WEBVTT

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:02.400
I'm done waiting.

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:06.650
I couldn't bear it if someone 
else took you from me.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.810
Good morning, Lady Catarina.

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:16.320
Did you sleep well?

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.660
Y-Yes...

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:20.060
<i>Oh, it was just a dream?</i>

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.750
<b>Doom</b>

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:48.560
<b>m 0 0 l 0 -7 b 7 -7 15 -15 15 -29 l 30 -30 l 29 -15 b 15 -15 7 -7 7 0 b 7 7 15 15 29 15 l 30 30 l 15 29 b 15 15 7 7 0 7 b -7 7 -15 15 -15 29 l -30 30 l -29 15 b -15 15 -7 7 -7 0 b -7 -7 -15 -15 -29 -15 l -30 -30 l -15 -29 b -15 -15 -7 -7 0 -7</b>

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:48.560
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess: 
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:56.510
<b>Episode 5
Love for the Younger Brothers Poured Forth...</b>

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:54.240
<i>With the kidnapping incident resolved,</i>

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:56.640
<i>I returned to the magic academy.</i>

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:00.580
<i>It seems the one behind the 
kidnapping was Rufus's master,</i>

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:02.280
<i>a marquis named David Mason.</i>

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:05.520
<i>Rufus told us all 
about his master's evil deeds,</i>

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:07.790
<i>and it was clear that he had been 
forced to do what he did,</i>

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:10.200
<i>so I don't think he'll be charged 
for any serious crimes.</i>

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:14.440
<i>I'm glad everything wrapped up 
without any major issues, but...</i>

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.640
Why are you all following me?

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:21.940
Our next classes are 
in separate classrooms, aren't they?

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:24.300
Because we don't want 
anything to happen to you!

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:26.370
But the whole kidnapping thing is over now.

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:28.090
That case may be closed,

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:30.250
but there's someone else who's after you.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:31.040
Huh?

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:32.570
N-Nothing!

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:35.640
You don't seem to remember it, 
so you don't need to worry about it.

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:38.760
The point is, everyone's worried about you.

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.540
R-Really?

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:42.260
Sorry I made you all worry.

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:46.760
We'll keep our eyes on you to make sure 
nothing like that happens again!

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:50.870
We'll meet you back here once 
the next class period is over.

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:53.950
Please don't go anywhere 
on your own before then.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.190
Uh, okay...

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:58.500
<i>They're being way too overprotective.</i>

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:10.290
Wow! This transformation looks...

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.460
even more boring and plain than usual.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:15.870
The disguise was a dull maid 
with no relations, after all.

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:23.030
Every single time you transform, 
it truly amazes me,

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:24.500
Susanna Randall.

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:27.680
I am honored by your praise, Prince Jeffrey.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:30.220
So, any news on the incident?

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.320
The kidnapper himself confessed everything.

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:35.820
His acquisition of dark magic,

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:39.770
and his use of Selena 
to kidnap Catarina Claes...

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:42.880
It was all orchestrated by David Mason.

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:47.640
As a part of the Jeffrey faction,

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:51.670
it seems Mason's desire to see you 
on the throne made him lose control.

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:53.670
Damn that Mason.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:57.570
How dare he try to hurt Ian 
and Geordo behind my back?

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.520
It's truly unforgivable.

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:03.050
I have no choice but 
to thoroughly stamp him out.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:05.950
Anyway, were my little brothers well?

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:07.850
Yes, they were just fine.

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.390
That's great!

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:22.080
Ah, my little brothers are simply wonderful!

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.800
I bet even Mason

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:29.530
has no idea that you're a freak with an 
abnormal adoration for your younger brothers.

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:32.560
Well, they're all just too wonderful!

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:34.470
Oh, just look at these faces!

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:36.650
Don't you think they look like angels?

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:38.950
When Geordo and Alan were born,

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:40.880
I was simply overjoyed!

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.030
The very first time I went to meet them,

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:44.750
I made a promise...

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:49.020
Wow, they're tiny!

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:50.800
They look like they'd break 
if I touched them.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:52.600
You can touch them.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.360
Really?

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:54.270
Yes.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:04:59.440
Wow!

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:01.360
He grabbed my finger!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.800
I think he's happy to meet his big brother.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:05.860
Really?!

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.120
He's so soft.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.130
Wanna touch them, too, Ian?

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:13.230
No.

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:17.790
Jeffrey, take good care 
of your little brothers, okay?

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:21.690
Sure! I'll protect my little brothers!

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:26.760
But I didn't have a chance 
to fulfill that promise.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:30.670
Because Alan was so frail, 
Mother stayed with him all the time,

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:35.980
and the rest of us brothers 
were raised separately by our own servants.

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:41.210
Around the same time, the former king died 
before declaring a successor,

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:43.190
and the royal palace was left in chaos.

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:47.390
Both my parents were always busy, 
so even though we all lived in the castle,

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:50.030
we stopped spending time 
together as a family.

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:52.610
And when Father became the king,

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:56.690
we brothers became involved in a battle 
among factions for the right to succession,

00:05:56.690 --> 00:05:59.290
which tore us all even further apart.

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:01.560
I was still very young myself,

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:03.450
so there was nothing I could do.

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:08.740
I feel like I made my younger 
brothers suffer terribly.

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:16.350
That's a lot of papers.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:20.040
For some reason, Mary brought me 
a ton of work to do.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:23.060
I don't even have time 
to go see Catarina now.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.280
Really? Well, good luck.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.780
You're welcome to help me out, Alan.

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:29.790
If I did that, Mary would...

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:33.500
I mean... That's student 
council work, isn't it?

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:35.960
I figured you'd say that.

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:40.010
Speaking of, this latest incident had 
the Department of Magic on the move.

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:42.060
Who do you think is behind that?

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:44.420
It can only be Jeffrey.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:48.780
He noticed that the kidnapper was acting 
strange before Catarina was even taken.

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:51.330
He probably talked to 
the Department of Magic in advance.

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:52.800
You think so, too, huh?

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:55.260
He always acts flippant,

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:58.440
but despite how he looks, 
he's always thinking about us.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.140
I guess he's always been like that.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:03.240
You're right.

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:08.050
Prince Geordo!

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:11.300
This is where you've been?

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:12.700
I've been looking for you.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:13.960
I'm sorry.

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:16.200
Why did you sneak out of your room?

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:20.480
I wanted to see Mother.

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:24.680
We were supposed to see each other 
at our birthday party today.

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:27.910
But Prince Alan has fallen ill.

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:31.670
You're a very good boy, 
so you can be patient, can't you?

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:34.010
Okay.

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:45.100
I finished all my assignments.

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:48.570
Did you? Impressive as 
always, Prince Geordo.

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.370
You're not going to pat my head?

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:54.270
Huh?

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:59.370
W-We could never do 
something so disrespectful!

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:01.640
Oh, okay.

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.700
What must I do to see Mother?

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:08.420
If you can be a good boy, 
I'm sure you'll see her soon.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:09.240
Really?

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:10.120
Yes.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.660
Where's Mother?

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.420
She cannot see you.

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:25.720
Prince Alan is in poor condition.

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:27.370
C'mon, Mom! Hurry!

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:27.730
I see.

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:28.490
Yes, I know.

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:29.990
Don't be in such a hurry.

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:31.290
C'mon, faster!

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:32.680
You're too slow!

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:41.190
<i>I feel sad and lonely 
because I get my hopes up.</i>

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:48.710
<i>If I don't get my hopes up, 
I won't have to feel that way.</i>

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:50.780
<i>Nothing will matter.</i>

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:54.040
<i>No expectations, no interest.</i>

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:57.430
<i>A boring, colorless world...</i>

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:01.930
Geordo! Are you well?

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.780
Yes, my health is satisfactory.

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:07.770
I'm sure you must be very busy. 
Please feel free to go back.

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:08.810
What?

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:12.410
I'm not that busy today. Let's talk more.

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:13.370
About what?

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:16.940
Well, let's see... 
What's your favorite food?

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:19.280
I have no likes or dislikes. 
I'll eat anything.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:20.920
How about your favorite book?

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:23.390
I'm open to many different genres.

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:24.410
Any hobbies?

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:26.810
I don't have any in particular.

00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:29.260
Why ask me all this?

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.870
I want to know more about you.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:34.400
I have nothing to talk about.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:35.970
You can go back now.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:39.030
Okay. I'll come by again.

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:45.020
<i>After I had lost interest in everything,</i>

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:47.130
<i>Jeffrey came to see me.</i>

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:49.800
<i>No matter how coldly I treated him,</i>

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:52.160
<i>he kept coming back, 
acting as flippant as ever.</i>

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:53.770
<i>And that was when...</i>

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:56.270
<i>I met Catarina Claes.</i>

00:09:56.270 --> 00:09:58.030
Lady Catarina!

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:00.810
Physically, they've found nothing wrong,

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:03.520
but it seems there is 
a wound on her forehead.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:05.600
Knowing the young lady,

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:09.430
she might demand that you become 
her fiancé to take responsibility.

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:10.790
I see.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:14.480
<i>The Claes family is not part of any faction,</i>

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:17.670
<i>so I wouldn't have to 
treat her any special way.</i>

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:22.570
<i>She should be the perfect choice 
for a fiancée that I can use</i>

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:24.620
<i>to decline unwanted engagement offers.</i>

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:31.130
Lady... Catarina?

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:35.200
<i>After that, my day-to-day 
life changed drastically.</i>

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:38.070
<i>I hadn't planned to give 
Catarina any special treatment,</i>

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:40.480
<i>but soon, I spent my days 
at the mercy of her whims.</i>

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:43.910
Look, Prince Geordo!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.740
These seedlings have grown beautifully!

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:48.160
They have?

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:48.830
Yes!

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:53.160
When they grow delicious 
tomatoes, I'll give you some!

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:56.050
Okay. I'll look forward to it.

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:01.850
Prince Geordo!

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:04.730
I was looking out my window, 
and I saw a gorgeous rainbow!

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:05.860
Let's go see it!

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:12.500
Isn't it beautiful?

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:24.090
Prince Geordo, thanks 
for all your help today!

00:11:24.090 --> 00:11:25.950
I had fun!

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:30.270
There's something 
I've been wanting to ask you.

00:11:30.810 --> 00:11:34.880
How are you able to 
voice your feelings so openly?

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:38.760
Um... I don't know if I'm being open.

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:43.260
My feelings just sort 
of slip right out on their own.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:46.760
My mother scolds me for it all the time.

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:51.520
<i>Then Alan started visiting 
the Claes household often.</i>

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:53.730
<i>He seemed to avoid me all the time,</i>

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:56.310
<i>so even at the castle, 
we rarely had any contact.</i>

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:00.650
<i>But through Catarina,</i>

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:03.320
<i>I started talking to Alan, too.</i>

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:07.950
I was thinking of giving 
Catarina some roses soon.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:12.540
Wouldn't vegetable seedlings 
make her happier than flowers?

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.520
You think so, too?

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:17.340
But I don't know what kind 
of vegetable to give her.

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:20.950
Yeah, I don't know much 
about vegetables, either.

00:12:20.950 --> 00:12:22.670
Why don't you ask the gardener?

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:25.230
Good idea. I'll try that.

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:34.440
You get along well with Alan now, huh?

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:38.910
I wouldn't go so far as to say we get along,

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:41.150
but we do talk more than we used to.

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:43.650
I see! That's great!

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:48.240
Thank you for worrying about me, Jeffrey.

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:01.290
Prince Alan, are you all right?

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:03.830
I'm... fine...

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:05.100
I'll get your medicine.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:08.260
<i>Why did this happen?</i>

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:11.870
<i>It's my and Geordo's birthday today...</i>

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:17.510
<i>I'm sick of just lying around 
in my room all the time.</i>

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:21.520
<i>I want to run and play 
outside sometimes, too.</i>

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:27.540
<i>My health finally improved to the point 
that I could walk around</i>

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:29.480
<i>when I turned five years old.</i>

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:32.550
<i>In hopes of making up for lost time,</i>

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:35.210
<i>I worked hard at sword 
practice and studying.</i>

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:36.410
<i>But...</i>

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:39.570
Prince Alan is just mediocre 
at everything he does.

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:44.190
Prince Geordo must've taken all the good 
qualities while they were in the womb.

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:46.860
So he's just what was left 
after the good stuff was taken?

00:13:49.400 --> 00:13:52.890
<i>No matter how hard I tried, 
I was no match for Geordo.</i>

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.320
<i>Consumed by the malicious words of others,</i>

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:59.350
<i>I was soon overwhelmed 
by an inferiority complex.</i>

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:06.670
<i>In contrast to me,</i>

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:10.190
<i>Geordo didn't seem to think 
anything of my presence at all.</i>

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:13.100
<i>That drove me even madder.</i>

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:25.070
What's wrong, Alan?

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:27.340
None of your business! Go away!

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:30.390
I'm not leaving. I came here to see you.

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.680
What do you want with me?

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:34.940
I don't have important business or anything.

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:36.900
I just wanted to see you.

00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:38.920
Are you feeling all right?

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:40.440
You can't tell by looking at me?

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:43.280
Have you seen Geordo to talk 
to him in person recently?

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:45.320
Why should I have to go see him?!

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.320
Are you just here to make fun of me?!

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:49.290
No, I'm not. I just—

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:50.950
Enough! Go away!

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.840
Okay. I'll come by again.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:03.570
<i>After that, I got engaged to Mary</i>

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:05.720
<i>and met Catarina Claes.</i>

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:08.170
Wh-What are you, a monkey?!

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:12.520
Prince Alan, you've got a bite!

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:16.650
A-Are you okay?!

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:24.780
<i>Through Catarina, I learned that</i>

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:26.980
<i>people have things they're good and bad at,</i>

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.420
<i>and there's no such thing 
as someone who's perfect.</i>

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:33.840
<i>I thought Geordo was someone perfect 
that I could never beat at anything,</i>

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:38.410
<i>but he was far more human 
than I had ever imagined.</i>

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:39.790
<i>Up until then,</i>

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:45.390
<i>I had feared Geordo so much 
that I never really saw who he was.</i>

00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:47.770
Catarina is my fiancée.

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:49.880
Please make sure you don't forget that.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.910
Of course I'm not gonna forget.

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:54.250
Why do you keep saying that over and over?

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:56.040
Because it's important.

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:03.590
You get along well with Geordo now, huh?

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:07.030
Yeah, well enough, I guess.

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:16.650
Thanks for always worrying 
about me, Jeffrey.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:21.370
Alan!

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:25.330
What are you doing?! Cut it out!

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:30.960
Jeffrey really has always 
acted very flippant, hasn't he?

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:35.300
And yet he thought 
about us more than anyone else.

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:39.770
Yes, when we were all scattered, 
he tried to bring us together.

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:44.480
I wish he'd stop treating us like little kids 
and hanging all over us, though.

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:49.440
Can you move now, Selena?

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.690
Yes, I'm fine now.

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:54.360
I really am glad you're both safe.

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:56.070
I guess it's all thanks to Jeffrey.

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:57.700
Prince Jeffrey?

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:00.960
He won't say anything, but I can tell.

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:05.050
Jeffrey's the one who solved this case, along 
with the Department of Magic.

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:11.080
All this time, I thought you 
and Prince Jeffrey... well...

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:13.180
You thought we saw each other as enemies?

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:14.890
I-I'm sorry!

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:16.350
Don't worry about it.

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:20.860
A long time ago, I couldn't figure 
out how Jeffrey felt, either.

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:25.850
It's me, Jeffrey.

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:35.020
Long time no see. How've you been?

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:37.050
Ian!

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:38.240
What's with you?

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:40.200
You don't hate me?!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:42.580
That's just what people are saying.

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:44.230
I see, I see!

00:17:44.230 --> 00:17:46.960
I've been worried all this time 
about how you were doing!

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:51.710
You haven't changed since way back 
when you said you'd protect us all.

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:54.560
You remember the promise I made then?

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:56.080
Yes, I do.

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:58.300
And you were still so little then!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.930
You're pretty amazing!

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:02.200
I just have a fairly good memory.

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:07.140
Until you came here, I had no 
idea what you thought about me.

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:10.520
I'm relieved to see 
that you haven't changed.

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:17.480
After that, we started meeting 
with each other to talk

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:19.570
in secret to the people 
in each of the factions.

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:21.360
I had no idea.

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:26.250
Jeffrey still cares as much 
about us now as he did back then.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:29.970
He does go a bit overboard 
and annoy us with it at times, though.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:36.830
I couldn't do anything for them,

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:40.090
but my little brothers all 
grew up to be so brilliant.

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:43.850
Looking back, things started 
moving in a positive direction

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:46.780
when Geordo and Alan got engaged.

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:50.840
I'm so grateful that my little 
brothers found such wonderful fiancées.

00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:55.020
And I'm glad to have you 
for my fiancée, as well.

00:18:57.720 --> 00:19:00.320
Hm? Is your story over now?

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:03.420
You weren't even listening?

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:06.430
I have work to do. I'm heading back now.

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:07.530
Susanna!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.620
No... As Larna of the Department of Magic,

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:13.500
I'd like to ask a favor of you.

00:19:14.070 --> 00:19:15.000
What is it?

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:17.210
This incident made it clear

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:20.260
that the dark magic that 
the royal family had been concealing

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:23.350
has become known 
to a certain group of people.

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:28.060
It's possible that more people will try 
to obtain that dark magic.

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:29.930
Please be alert.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:34.110
I know. I'll keep my eyes open.

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:44.970
I finally get to be alone.

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:49.870
<i>Sorry, everyone, but I need some time 
to myself now and then, too.</i>

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:50.870
Catarina.

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:53.020
P-Prince Geordo!

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:54.840
Ah, I finally get to see you.

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:02.160
So much has gotten in my way since then.

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:05.260
I couldn't spend even a few minutes 
with you, and I missed you,

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:06.930
my beloved princess.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:10.320
That's an unusual reaction.

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:14.270
Have you become a bit more 
aware of me since what happened?

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:16.460
Since what... happened?

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:20.360
Oh, it's just... I had a weird 
dream after the kidnapping...

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:21.580
A dream?

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:26.070
Yes, one where you and I... um...

00:20:26.270 --> 00:20:28.200
Why is she turning red?!

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:30.040
There's no reason to get shy over a dream!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:33.040
She's had no romantic experience 
in her past life or this one.

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:35.120
You can't blame her for being embarrassed.

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:36.470
That's true!

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:38.310
With a pretty face like that gazing at you,

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:41.090
a word like "kiss" doesn't come out so easily!

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:42.910
If he finds out she had such a dream,

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:46.180
he'll think she's a creep 
who's just frustrated!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:49.100
P-Please, not that!

00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:50.560
U-Um...

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:54.800
Was the dream... something like this?

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.860
You thought it was a dream?

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:07.050
It's not a dream now, 
and it wasn't then, either.

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:10.190
Wh-Why?

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:12.410
Are you asking why I kissed you?

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:15.150
Because I love you, of course.

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:19.790
You finally realize it now? I'm so glad.

00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:22.000
Hold it!

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:24.220
Stop!

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:26.970
Don't you dare get any closer to my sister!

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:26.970
Step aside, Master Keith!

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:28.830
I'll use my magic!

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:31.180
H-Hang on, Mary! What are you gonna—

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:33.500
No, Lady Mary! I'll handle this!

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:35.600
E-Everyone, please, calm down!

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.920
At least keep the injuries mild enough 
that I can heal them with my magic!

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:43.040
No! That's not enough! I can't hold back!

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:43.040
Calm down, Mary!

00:21:43.040 --> 00:21:46.990
The two of us should work together 
and hit them with our combined magic!

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:49.000
<i>Is this a dream, too?!</i>

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:50.190
<i>Ow!</i>

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:52.950
<i>It's real!</i>

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:36.580
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:43.420
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:22:51.140 --> 00:22:51.800
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:22:58.100 --> 00:22:58.770
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:23:30.580 --> 00:23:34.030
Congrats on beating 
the black-hearted prince's route!
